{"id":"supersaw","title":"Supersaw","subtitle":"Sandstorm-style riff · 136 BPM","author":"Opus 5.5","source":"examples/supersaw.asm","profile":"spu-1","format":"RGB888","engines":["CPU","GPU","SPU"],"payloadBytes":4012,"cartridgeBytes":4044,"cartridgeSha256":"89b16c42e4ac3227aea45f65f773e86fbb5bc61734f4d4923bfeb27be1845774","rgbaSha256":"c94be68deb25a12df4e65cfe676ec237644c7cb468b888c09498f920f999dd07","wasmSha256":"fd523f43234209258eff3adc50873f136271f08a5ead5f2908e4aee7ee742ef8","frames":758,"seconds":12.633333333333333,"firstVisibleFrame":2,"halted":false,"gpuDispatches":1517,"gpuBudgetPercent":1.79931640625,"spuBlocks":2368,"audioPeak":0.7944495677947998,"lines":929,"instructions":730,"notes":["SUPERSAW  --  a thick JP-8000-style supersaw playing a Sandstorm-style","riff (homage), 136 BPM, with a live spectrum analyser. DB32 spu-1.","SPU: stateless per-sample synthesis plus a 1024-sample history ring.","CPU: copies the ring oldest-first each frame. GPU pass 1 runs 160","Goertzel filters over it; pass 2 draws LED bars and the waveform."],"excerpt":".profile spu-1\n.entry start\n.equ FB0,   0x10000\n.equ FB1,   0x1E100\n.equ AOUT,  0x2C200           ; SPU output block (2048 bytes) ...\n.equ RING,  0x2CA00           ; ... the SPU's 512-sample mono history (24 kHz) ...\n.equ REV,   0x2D200           ; ... and 1024 reverb records of 4 bf16 (8 KB)\n.equ RINGC, 0x2F200           ; oldest-first copy of the history for the GPU\n.equ SPECA, 0x2FA00           ; 40 [bar, peak] pairs, ping-pong\n.equ SPECB, 0x2FB40\nstart:\n    li r1, cfg\n    lw r2, 0(r1)\ncfg_next:\n    lw r3, 4(r1)\n    addi r1, r1, 8\n    jal r15, copy\n    lw r2, 0(r1)","description":"A JP-8000-style supersaw (three seven-voice PolyBLEP layers, 21 saws) playing a Sandstorm-style riff at 136 BPM, with a kick-ducked FDN reverb, ping-pong delay, bass and drums. The GPU runs 40 Goertzel filters over the live mix to draw an LED spectrum analyser above the waveform.","scenes":null,"poster":"supersaw.png","gif":"supersaw.gif","gifFps":15,"gifFrames":79,"keyframes":[{"file":"supersaw-k00.png","frame":444},{"file":"supersaw-k01.png","frame":488},{"file":"supersaw-k02.png","frame":532},{"file":"supersaw-k03.png","frame":576},{"file":"supersaw-k04.png","frame":624},{"file":"supersaw-k05.png","frame":668},{"file":"supersaw-k06.png","frame":712},{"file":"supersaw-k07.png","frame":756}],"bytes":"supersaw-bytes.png","payloadHex":"","audio":{"rms":"cGaVl9HXws/uwZyNlqaFj5Cq7/WOj5qygpySn6avv73U3+bVxY2Tl2t5gpLg7pOSlrZdfI6kgItye/j/+8PHwYaHdIaYj8jgqrWNomRql6mBdIuI8fPP1b6Tant/gISIpLfU2n+CdHeMkHZxk5TV27/P8bmSkJChh5GMq/j7kpaYrYejjZiqrL/C1OHn0r6IlpxufIGS3uyPipKyXn4=","wave":"","scope":"","fps":15,"scopeLen":128,"scopeStereo":true}}